# Tutorial images build the SDK from source, but do not need developer builds,
# repository metadata, documentation, tests, or package-manager caches. Keep an
# allowlist so ignored multi-gigabyte build trees are never sent to Docker
# Desktop's Linux VM.
**
!.dockerignore
!CMakeLists.txt

!cmake/
!cmake/**
!include/
!include/**
!proto/
!proto/**
!src/
!src/**
!third_party/
!third_party/**

!examples/
!examples/tutorials/
!examples/tutorials/**
